## 10. Hardening checklist

The full hardening checklist has been completed and signed separately. Summary:

- ☐ Host firewall enabled, default deny inbound
- ☐ No password-based remote shell access
- ☐ All default credentials changed and recorded in your vault
- ☐ Multi-factor authentication on all administrative accounts
- ☐ UPnP disabled, no port forwarding, remote gateway management disabled
- ☐ Interface-based administration disabled on the router, switches and access points, on every
      interface except the intended one
- ☐ Cameras: default account removed, cloud and peer-to-peer features disabled, firmware current
- ☐ Wireless: WPA3 or WPA2-AES, no WPS, unique key per segment, management not exposed over wireless
- ☐ Guest network isolated with client isolation
- ☐ Unused switch ports disabled
- ☐ Logging enabled with defined retention
- ☐ External vulnerability scan clean, result attached

